  'TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testManageRenamesClearsDataAndRemovesOnlyAfterConfirmation'
  'TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testTronMenuListsInstalledAppAndKeepsItsValuesAcrossReopen'
  'TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testHomeAutomationEditorAndAttributedMessageLight'
