  "TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testAnsweringAskUserInReopenedRunningSessionKeepsTranscriptMounted"
  "TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testStreamedReplyAppearsExactlyOnceAcrossReconnect"
  "TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testSessionModelChangeReachesNextPromptAndUndoRestoresIt"
  "TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testHomeSettingsCardDeclineAppliesNothingAndDoubleApproveAppliesOnce"
  "TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testCompletedAskUserColdReplayRetainsSelectedAnswers"
  "TronMobileUITests/RealGatewayPairAndChatUITests/testCodemodeAskUserOpensFromItsToolRowAndAcceptsAnAnswer"
